# THE CONSOLE LAYOUT (0.17.3: every theme's; Console the default palette, theme 0): home's five channel strips, a voice's pages
# its strip opened wide (the pad on keys, a line as a roll, the drums as a grid) with the others folded at the side, the sequencer a
# tracker, faders; a muted voice dims. Theme 1 (Imp's colours): the same layout in other colours.
seed 0
wait 3000
expect theme 0
expect playing 1
shot looks_home.png
turn SELECT 1 100
wait 1500
expect view 1
shot looks_pad.png
turn SELECT 8 100
wait 1500
expect view 9
shot looks_bassline.png
turn SELECT 4 100
wait 1500
expect view 13
shot looks_acidline.png
turn SELECT 5 100
wait 1500
expect view 18
shot looks_dejavu.png
turn SELECT 2 100
wait 1500
expect view 20
shot looks_drums.png
press GLO
wait 100
tapkey 12
wait 100
release GLO
wait 1500
expect trkmute 32
shot looks_drums_acidmuted.png
press GLO
wait 100
tapkey 12
wait 100
release GLO
wait 100
expect trkmute 0
press SEQ
wait 500
release SEQ
wait 1200
expect view 35
shot looks_seq.png
turn SELECT -20 100
wait 300
tap GLO
wait 100
expect view 32
spin K2 1
wait 200
expect theme 1
shot looks_global_imp.png
turn SELECT -32 100
wait 1500
expect view 0
shot looks_home_imp.png
# the settings walk as a sheet: the page's four settings large, the walk down the right
tap GLO
wait 100
spin K2 -1
wait 200
expect theme 0
shot looks_global.png
press HOME
wait 900
release HOME
wait 300
expect fxpage 27
shot looks_settings_filters.png
turn SELECT 2 100
wait 300
expect fxpage 18
shot looks_settings_settings.png
tap FX
wait 300
# the FX menu (0.17.6): the banks as tabs, the keys as tiles; one held, one latched
tap FX
wait 300
expect fxon 1
press SAVE
tapkey 3
release SAVE
wait 100
key 8 down
wait 200
shot looks_fx.png
key 8 up
tapkey 3
tap FX
wait 300
expect fxon 0
# JAM: Sound on the fourth knob
turn SELECT 2 100
wait 1500
expect view 34
shot looks_jam.png
# a picture page (0.17.8): the title on a panel strip, the curve on a dark screen with a grid
turn SELECT -32 100
wait 1500
expect view 2
shot looks_padenv.png
# a help card (a button held alone): a sheet
press LFO
wait 1500
shot looks_help.png
release LFO
wait 300
# the step pages and Answer as rolls (0.17.9): a block a note, an accent taller, a slide a line into its note
turn SELECT 13 100
wait 1200
expect view 15
shot looks_acsteps.png
turn SELECT 4 100
wait 1200
expect view 19
shot looks_cmsteps.png
turn SELECT -9 100
wait 1200
expect view 10
shot looks_blsteps.png
turn SELECT 4 100
wait 1200
expect view 14
shot looks_answer.png
# the overlays: GLO held (the mix) and SEL held (the shift), the FX menu's tiles and tabs
press GLO
wait 700
shot looks_mix.png
release GLO
wait 300
press SEL
wait 700
shot looks_shift.png
release SEL
wait 300
